  {
    "name": "Factorization",
    "kind": "function",
    "signature": "(<RngIntElt> n) -> RngIntEltFact, RngIntElt",
    "summary": "The prime factorization of a nonzero integer n, as [<p, e>, ...], and its sign.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "code": "Factorization(360);",
        "expected": "[ <2, 3>, <3, 2>, <5, 1> ]\n"
      },
      {
        "code": "f, s := Factorization(-12); f, s;",
        "expected": "[ <2, 2>, <3, 1> ]\n-1\n"
      }
    ],
    "differs": [
      "Magma's third return value (the composite factors it left unfactored, with Proof := false or bounds) is not returned; its parameters (Proof, Bases, ECMLimit, ...) are not accepted."
    ],
    "status": "partial",
    "see_also": [
      "PrimeDivisors",
      "Divisors"
    ],
    "upstream_version": "Magma 2.18",
    "tags": [
      "integers"
    ]
  },
